<title>UK: Greece tenders for 500,000-600,000 tonnes gas oil.</title>
<headline>Greece tenders for 500,000-600,000 tonnes gas oil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece has tendered for 500,000-600,000 tonnes of gas oil for delivery over the winter, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Traders said the tender, due to close on September 17, was mainly for heating oil and possibly one or two cargoes of 0.05 percent diesel.</p>
<p>Delivery would take place from October 1996 to March 1997.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714</p>
